Base passes only. B2 on addr.elem, vec.load and vec.store of a ref mut slice, a ptr mut slice and a shared aligned slice; not on a slice of arrays; the element pointer of the mutable slices is ptr mut T, the one of the shared slice ptr const T, which B2 adds to the type table; B2' moves the three slice.ptr of one slice to the param's place and keeps the single ones where B2 put them.
